{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西藏吉隆泥石流，發生至今近兩周，當局確認部分遇難者身份。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.TIBET-1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026hxs88vKaDK1788754091.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.TIBET-1200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當地的應急救援指揮部消息指，除了繼續搜救工作，已成立專家團隊，調集60多名法醫，開展遇難人員身份識別工作，目前已確認部分遇難者身份。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次泥石流至今累計造成43人遇難，519人失蹤。當地後續將深入評估周邊災害風險，研究口岸功能恢復等事宜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.TIBET-1200_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260deCR8nnvp1788754104.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.TIBET-1200_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T04:20:02.645230+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}